        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "When he was in distress, he begged the LORD his God, and humbled himself greatly before the God of his fathers.",
      "ko": "저가 환난을 당하여 그 하나님 여호와께 간구하고 그 열조의 하나님 앞에 크게 겸비하여",
      "source_text_hash": "4ac28b73de320f1735aa6128e29d18ae1b1cb51e85ac1862ea2fa1316024fb74",
      "translation_text_hash": "a365e41909b7917dd5b50f760fdbd03dab6cd89828d59fcb805ea279d6103c55",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 환난을 당하여 그 하나님 여호와께 간구하고 그 열조의 하나님 앞에 크게 겸비하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a365e41909b7917dd5b50f760fdbd03dab6cd89828d59fcb805ea279d6103c55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:33:13",
      "sequence": 11922,
      "chapter_label": "2CH 33",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2CH",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "He prayed to him; and he was entreated by him, and heard his supplication, and brought him again to Jerusalem into his kingdom. Then Manasseh knew that the LORD was God.",
      "ko": "기도한고로 하나님이 그 기도를 받으시며 그 간구를 들으시사 저로 예루살렘에 돌아와서 다시 왕위에 거하게 하시매 므낫세가 그제야 여호와께서 하나님이신 줄을 알았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f08a3aec3362c3397dfadf4e10a85d8d50303bee819c7c0b933daae9e21be04d",
      "translation_text_hash": "7d7dbc62036629244a47cb2f2d7af18e02e5b5bbe983c6407f4152349307ace7",
