      "en": "Nevertheless the people still sacrificed in the high places, but only to the LORD their God.",
      "ko": "백성이 그 하나님 여호와께만 제사를 드렸으나 오히려 산당에서 제사를 드렸더라",
      "source_text_hash": "c65865827fc9f23ca7599c74d5aa88273c34a5949e382308cef8c7cb9c95cdf1",
      "translation_text_hash": "90af149d66c1c5e9c0479c7c0f75d5adc4f076371190b39cac684ea7e7e6ac16",
