      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight, as did Manasseh his father; and Amon sacrificed to all the engraved images which Manasseh his father had made, and served them.",
      "ko": "그 부친 므낫세의 행함 같이 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 그 부친 므낫세가 만든 아로새긴 모든 우상에게 제사하여 섬겼으며",
      "source_text_hash": "ab69485a73ea149ea74405eed1b37ae8f9cb2d24ec2b30e7dc2795afadf5e97f",
      "translation_text_hash": "e17e4c7206ff1c1899c2c57146a95c1134de9d2dee82163d03a17c9cdc45c1a5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 부친 므낫세의 행함 같이 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 그 부친 므낫세가 만든 아로새긴 모든 우상에게 제사하여 섬겼으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e17e4c7206ff1c1899c2c57146a95c1134de9d2dee82163d03a17c9cdc45c1a5"
